## Git Workflow

### Branch Naming

- **Feature Branches:** `feature/description`
- **Bug Fixes:** `fix/description`
- **Hotfixes:** `hotfix/description`
- **Refactoring:** `refactor/description`

### Commit Messages

- **Format:** Use conventional commit format
  ```
  type(scope): subject

  body (optional)

  footer (optional)
  ```
- **Types:** `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `docs`, `style`, `test`, `chore`
- **Examples:**
  ```
  feat(audio): add granular synthesis engine
  fix(ui): remove waveform ghosting artifacts
  refactor(waveform): optimize buffer access
  ```

### File Organization

- **Ignore:** Add build artifacts to `.gitignore`
  ```
  build/
  sdkconfig
  sdkconfig.old
  *.bin
  *.elf
  ```

### Code Review

- **Self-Review:** Review your own code before committing
- **Testing:** Test changes before pushing
- **Documentation:** Update documentation for API changes

