## Project-Specific Rules

### Audio Processing

- **Sample Rate:** 44.1kHz (CD quality)
- **Buffer Size:** <128 samples for low latency
- **Format:** 16-bit PCM, stereo
- **DAC:** PCM5102A or ES8388 (external DAC required)

### UI System

- **Theme:** Support AMBER, CYAN, GREEN themes
- **Resolution:** 480x272 (RGB565)
- **Frame Rate:** Target 60 FPS
- **Touch:** GT911 capacitive touch controller

### Waveform Display

- **Bars:** 480 bars (configurable resolution)
- **Scrolling:** Fixed playhead, scrolling waveform
- **Performance:** Direct buffer access, no ghosting
- **Grid:** Beat grid overlay support

### Track Management

- **Formats:** MP3, FLAC, WAV
- **Storage:** SD card and USB host
- **Metadata:** ID3 tag support
- **Database:** In-memory track database

