## Quick Reference

### Common Patterns

**Initialization:**
```c
esp_err_t component_init(void) {
    if (s_initialized) {
        ESP_LOGW(TAG, "Already initialized");
        return ESP_OK;
    }
    
    // Initialize...
    s_initialized = true;
    ESP_LOGI(TAG, "Component initialized");
    return ESP_OK;
}
```

**Error Handling:**
```c
bool operation(void) {
    if (error_condition) {
        ESP_LOGE(TAG, "Operation failed: reason");
        return false;
    }
    return true;
}
```

**FreeRTOS Task:**
```c
void task_function(void *arg) {
    while (1) {
        // Task work
        vTaskDelay(pdMS_TO_TICKS(100));
    }
}
```

**PSRAM Allocation:**
```c
void *buffer = heap_caps_malloc(size, MALLOC_CAP_SPIRAM);
if (buffer == NULL) {
    ESP_LOGE(TAG, "PSRAM allocation failed");
    return false;
}
// Use buffer...
free(buffer);
```

